      <h1>{{ resort.short }} Resort: <em>The Full Guide</em></h1>
      <p class="lead">Kidani Village is the Disney Vacation Club building next to Animal Kingdom Lodge, with its own savanna views and its own table-service restaurant, Sanaa. Deluxe Studios sleep four; one-bedroom villas sleep five; two-bedroom villas sleep nine; Grand Villas sleep twelve. Samawati Springs Pool is at this building. All four parks are buses.</p>
