      <dt>Address</dt><dd>Next to Animal Kingdom Lodge. The lodge hotel lists 2901 Osceola Parkway, Lake Buena Vista, FL 32830; confirm Kidani's check-in address on your reservation. <span class="verify">[verify Kidani street address]</span></dd>
      <dt>Size</dt><dd>A separate village building from Jambo House, with its own lobby, Sanaa and Samawati Springs Pool. Savanna views look at one of the animal savannas; Resort Views look at the pool or parking.</dd>
      <dt>Rooms</dt><dd>Deluxe Studios sleep 4; one-bedroom villas sleep 5; two-bedroom villas sleep 9; three-bedroom Grand Villas sleep 12. A single child under 3 in a crib does not count toward the maximum.</dd>
