      <dt>Getting around</dt><dd>Buses to all four parks, the water parks and Disney Springs. There is no monorail, boat or Skyliner from this resort.</dd>
      <dt>Food</dt><dd>Sanaa, in Kidani Village, with a quick-service breakfast and table-service lunch and dinner. Guests typically can also use the restaurants at Jambo House; confirm access if that matters to you. <span class="verify">[verify shared dining access]</span></dd>
      <dt>Pools</dt><dd>Samawati Springs Pool at Kidani (128-foot slide, zero-depth entry, Uwanja Camp water playground). Official Animal Kingdom Lodge pool pages also describe Uzima Springs Pool at Jambo House.</dd>
