  <section id="pools">
    <h2>Pools and things to do</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Samawati Springs Pool</strong> is at Kidani Village. Official Animal Kingdom Lodge pool pages describe a 128-foot slide, zero-depth entry, 4,700 square feet and 118,138 gallons, plus Uwanja Camp, a water playground with three zones. Official text says children 4 and younger can use Observation Station, with a shallow cistern pool and a bubbling geyser, while adults watch nearby.</li>
      <li><strong>Uzima Springs Pool</strong> is at Jambo House: 11,000 square feet, 234,980 gallons, zero-depth entry and a 67-foot slide, facing Uzima Savanna, per the same official pool page.</li>
    </ul>
